#    in the air below it with its $07 ($0ED2) set to 1: pushed under it
#    and hurt ($83:C40E on), V_141C set ($83:C428). Then at x $04D0 (out
#    of its box across, in it up and down) and back at $04A8: pushed off
#    to the left ($83:C441), again to x $04B0: to the right.
# 2. Stage a4 s1, the camera and Aladdin placed near the kind $3D with
